This repository is a fork of ucsim, the microcontroller simulator that is
part of SDCC (Small Device C Compiler).

Upstream version:  ucsim 0.8.15
Upstream source:   SDCC 4.5.0, obtained from the Debian orig tarball at
                   https://deb.debian.org/debian/pool/main/s/sdcc/sdcc_4.5.0+dfsg.orig.tar.xz
                   (path within tarball: sdcc-4.5.0+dfsg/sim/ucsim/)
Upstream licence:  GNU General Public License, version 2 or later (GPL-2.0-or-later)
                   See LICENSE in this repository and ucsim/COPYING.

What was changed:

  STC12C5A60S2 and STC15F2K60S2 processor models were added.
  The following files were CREATED (new work, Copyright 2026
  CrispStrobe, GPL-2.0-or-later):

    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/ucstc12cl.h
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/ucstc12.cc
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_timercl.h
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_timer.cc
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_pcacl.h
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_pca.cc
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_adccl.h
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_adc.cc
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_portcl.h
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_port.cc
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_wdtcl.h
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_wdt.cc
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/stc12_trace.cc

  The following upstream files were MODIFIED to register the new models:

    ucsim/src/core/utils.src/stypes.h       — added CPU_STC12 enum value
    ucsim/src/core/utils.src/globals.cc      — added STC12/STC15 entries to cpus_51
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/sim51.cc          — added CPU_STC12 case to mk_controller
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/uc51.cc           — added STC12/STC15 SFR names to sfr_tab51
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/regs51.h          — added STC12/STC15 SFR address defines
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/objs.mk           — added STC12 object files
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/Makefile.in       — added stc12_trace build target
    ucsim/src/sims/s51.src/pca.cc            — fixed PWM output polarity (§5.3)

  Each modified file carries a change notice per GPL-2 section 2(a).

This fork exists to provide a GPL-licensed STC12/STC15 simulation oracle
for the BrickWright toolchain.  It must NEVER be bundled into brickwright-lite
(which is MIT and ships on app stores); it is kept separate specifically to
maintain that licence boundary.
